  "segments": [
   {
    "id": "t1",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 3.04,
    "text": "So I lost 15 pounds in 20 days and I'm going to tell you exactly how I did it."
   },
   {
    "id": "t2",
    "start": 3.04,
    "end": 6.96,
    "text": "I'm Bray. I'm a fitness specialist and I just want to help you reach your goal because"
   },
   {
    "id": "t3",
    "start": 6.96,
    "end": 11.52,
    "text": "it's really not that hard. First things first, it's all mental. If you think you can do it,"
   },
   {
    "id": "t4",
    "start": 11.52,
    "end": 14.56,
    "text": "you can do it. If you don't think you can do it, you're not going to be able to do it. So"
   },
   {
    "id": "t5",
    "start": 14.56,
    "end": 18.0,
    "text": "you need to be able to be stronger than the voice that's in your head that's telling you"
   },
   {
    "id": "t6",
    "start": 18.0,
    "end": 21.52,
    "text": "go eat that burger, go get Chick-fil-A. You got to be stronger than that, okay?"
   },
   {
    "id": "t7",
    "start": 22.24,
    "end": 26.56,
    "text": "Second thing, you need to eliminate your sugar addiction. If you didn't know, your body runs"
   },
   {
    "id": "t8",
    "start": 26.56,
    "end": 30.96,
    "text": "off sugar, aka glucose. So if you stop feeding yourself sugar, your body will burn the sugar"
   },
   {
    "id": "t9",
    "start": 30.96,
    "end": 35.52,
    "text": "that is stored. Next thing, you need to be drinking a hundred ounces of water a day."
   },
   {
    "id": "t10",
    "start": 35.52,
    "end": 38.72,
    "text": "Really, you should be drinking your body weight in ounces, but a hundred ounces will do because"
   },
   {
    "id": "t11",
    "start": 38.72,
    "end": 41.68,
    "text": "you didn't know your body actually flushes out the fat cells through your bloodstream,"
   },
   {
    "id": "t12",
    "start": 41.68,
    "end": 44.8,
    "text": "and you pee it out. You don't poop it out. I literally thought you poop out the fat,"
   },
   {
    "id": "t13",
    "start": 44.8,
    "end": 48.72,
    "text": "but you pee out the fat, okay? So that's why you need to stay hydrated with a hundred ounces of"
   },
   {
    "id": "t14",
    "start": 48.72,
    "end": 53.36,
    "text": "water. But if you need a detailed list on what to eat, what foods to avoid, what time to eat,"
   },
   {
    "id": "t15",
    "start": 53.36,
    "end": 58.56,
    "text": "how much to eat. I have that all in a meal plan on my website under a fat loss guide and honestly"
   },
   {
    "id": "t16",
    "start": 58.56,
    "end": 62.32,
    "text": "those are the three things that help me lose 15 pounds in 20 days because I decided that I rather"
   },
   {
    "id": "t17",
    "start": 62.32,
    "end": 66.96,
    "text": "be uncomfortable for 20 days rather than 20 years in my own body so the choice is really up to you."
   },
   {
    "id": "t18",
    "start": 66.96,
    "end": 69.76,
    "text": "Go ahead and check it out and I wish you the best on your journey."
   }
  ]
 },
